        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Find Best Match"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "FIND_BEST_MATCH",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1764859176042",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764859176044_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI Matching Agent. Your task is to evaluate a list of Gigs and Jobs and determine how well each one matches a given list of skills. Shortlist the top 5 from the given list. You must return a clean JSON response with ranked matches.\n\n##You will receive:\n1.EmployeeSkills (array) : {{$context.$variables.ExtractedSkills}}\n\n2. Opportunities (Gigs & Jobs):  {{$context.$nodes.COLLATE_OPPORTUNITIES.$output.result}}\nEach opportunity (Gig or Job) contains fields such as:\nTitle\nLocation\nDescription\nEmployerDescriptionStr, \nDescriptionStr,\nBookmarkFlag,\nHasAppliedFlag, etc.\n\n##WHAT THE AGENT MUST DO\n1.Disqualify Opportunities Based on Criteria\n- For type \"Job\" do not shortlist if \n    - The value of BookmarkFlag = true \n    - or if value of HasAppliedFlag = true\n- For the type \"Gig' do not short list if \n   - The value of HasAppliedFlag = true\n   -  The value of GigValidFlag = false\n\n2. Extract Skills From Each Opportunity\nFrom the Title, Description, and other text fields:\n- Identify technology skills\n- Domain skills\n- Tools\n- Certifications\n- Industry-specific keywords\n- Action skills (e.g., “project management”, “customer handling”)\n- Normalize terms (e.g., “JS” → “JavaScript”)\n\n3. Compare With EmployeeSkills\nFor each opportunity:\n- MatchedSkills → which candidate skills appear in the opportunity\n- PartialMatches → close semantic matches\n   (e.g., “databases” ~ “MySQL”, “cloud” ~ “AWS”)\n- RelevanceScore (0–100)\n   Formula should consider:\n   - of matched skills\n   - weight partial matches lower\n   - keyword importance in Title > Description\n\nReturn the output in Valid JSON format."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"CandidateSkills\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"required\": [],\n        \"properties\": {}\n      }\n    },\n    \"OpportunitiesRanked\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"uniqueItems\": true,\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"JobId\",\n          \"JobNumber\",\n          \"Title\",\n          \"Type\",\n          \"RelevanceScore\"\n        ],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"GigId\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {},\n            \"required\": []\n          },\n          \"JobId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"JobNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"Title\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"Type\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"Location\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {},\n            \"required\": []\n          },\n          \"MatchedSkills\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"required\": [],\n              \"properties\": {}\n            }\n          },\n          \"PartialMatches\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"required\": [],\n              \"properties\": {}\n            }\n          },\n          \"RelevanceScore\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"CandidateSkills\",\n    \"OpportunitiesRanked\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Skills",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const candProfile = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.CandidateProfile ;\n\nconst profileJson = JSON.parse(candProfile);\n\nconst skills = profileJson.Skills|| [] ;\n\nconst skillKeywords = skills.map(keyword => keyword.Skill || keyword.SkillName ).join(\", \");\n\nconst finalObj = {\nPersonId : profileJson.PersonId,\nSkills : skillKeywords\n};\n\nreturn finalObj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1764845331184"
          },
